      <activity id="8454aa02-4bce-5dda-b9e9-00dc42d9a49a" activityNameId="c0768749-28ee-5f3e-91a3-ae191a6d1a6a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Boron trifluoride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Boron trifluoride, at plant
The process "boron trifluoride , at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  boron trifluoride  from boric acid and hydrofluoric acid in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007637-07-2; 
Formula: BF3; 
UUID: f3952cae-45ad-3ba0-8cb6-2a8f1e43603f
Production of boron trifluoride including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Fluorination of boric acid
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f3952cae-45ad-3ba0-8cb6-2a8f1e43603f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
